#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. お前も霧切の主張の意味が分からないのだろう？
#. 俺の推理は間違ってなどいないはずだ…！
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What Kyoko said doesn't make any sense to you either,\n"
"right? My inferences are never wrong...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Mình cần phải suy nghĩ lại một lần nữa. Chắc chắn phải có\n"
"điểm mâu thuẫn nào đó trong này...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>プロテインの容器が娯楽室に持ち込まれたのは、
#. 密室が破られた後だったと証明する根拠…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something can prove that someone brought the protein\n"
"can into the rec room *after* it was opened...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>密室が破られた時…
#. つまり、ボクが窓ガラスを割った時だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When the \"locked room\" was unlocked... In other words,\n"
"when I broke the window...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その点から考えてみれば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I concentrate on that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
